ect (2).png", "id": "24233615029578253", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304845_24233615046244918_2003497461901909154_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=--R1U34PBWMQ7kNvwGygn5l&_nc_oc=Adqx-3znVIswLpzP29xRc42V-OlXfX3uq4ba2saijOq5PUFnQc5IOnXo5LpGcuvGfGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSB0rUKH8IobAf7nmDnE8i4QwlJHWN53RapUDfT3fMMaw&oe=6B006692"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chimpmare", "keywords": ["Chimp", "Monkey", "Gorilla", "Horror", "Scary"], "long_description": "Welcome to Chimpmare! An unforgettable experience with tons of fun but creepy horror levels! \n\nChimpmare has 3 main game modes. \n\nA shop where you can deck out your player with loads of hats to choose from.\n\nAn amazing PvP map that makes players fight inside a volcano!\n\nAnd of course, horror levels to make you jump and run!\n\nInside the horror levels, you must complete an objective to move on. Weather its trying to find a diamond and avoid a massive spider, or finding a shovel to escape this place, the horror levels are the main part of the game.\n\nTo buy cosmetics in-game, you must collect gold around the horror levels to receive in-game currency, enabling you to deck out your player.\n\nFind it here in Chimpmare!", "short_description": "You should definitely download Chimpmare, an awesome VR game that has 3 awesome game modes such as a terrifying horror, shop, and intense PvP action into one unforgettable experience. Whether you're exploring eerie environments that will keep you on edge, browsing unique in-game shops for upgrades, or battling other players in fast-paced combat, Chimpmare delivers nonstop thrills. Dive into the chaos and see if you can survive the nightmare!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpmarevr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": nu